OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed schoolgirl in 'panic
OL,4,Amode', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA schoolgirl who was stabbed by a
OL,7,Fmasked fellow pupil at school described
OL,8,Fhow "everything was going numb" and she
OL,9,Fhad "blood all over her hands", a court
OL,10,Fhas been told.
OL,12,FPolice were called to Thorpe St Andrew
OL,13,FSchool, near Norwich, on 11 March,
OL,14,Ffollowing reports that a 15-year-old
OL,15,Fgirl had been stabbed in the back.
OL,17,FThe defendant, who is now 16 and cannot
OL,18,Fbe named for legal reasons, has denied
OL,19,Fa charge of attempted murder, but has
OL,20,Fadmitted possessing a kitchen knife
OL,21,Fwithout lawful authority and wounding
OL,22,Fwith intent.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
