OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed schoolgirl in 'panic
OL,4,Amode', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a police interview played to the
OL,7,Fcourt, the girl described how she went
OL,8,Finto "panic mode" after being stabbed,
OL,9,FKing's Lynn Crown Court heard.
